"en": "Al-Fatihah is the opening of the Qur'an and the surah recited in every unit of prayer. It moves in three steps. First, praise: Allah is Lord of all the worlds, the Most Compassionate, the Most Merciful, Master of the Day of Judgement. Then a promise from us: “You alone we worship, and You alone we ask for help.” Finally a request: guide us to the straight path — the path of those You have blessed, not of those who earned anger or went astray.",
