"en": "Ash-Sharh speaks to the Prophet ﷺ with three reminders: Allah opened his chest, removed the burden that weighed on his back, and raised his mention. Then comes the promise repeated twice: with hardship comes ease. The surah ends by saying that when one task is finished, keep working, and turn to your Lord with longing.",
